{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07474","headline":"送宇文迁明府赴洪州张观察追摄丰城令 · 刘长卿","name":"送宇文迁明府赴洪州张观察追摄丰城令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送君不复远爲心，余亦扁舟湘水阴。\n路逐山光何处尽，春随草色向南深。\n陈蕃待客应悬榻，宓贱之官独抱琴。\n傥见主人论谪宦，尔来空有白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}